      "text": "Here is a https://t.co/OQ86ZplPQC traffic audit- carried out by ME analyzing  traffic with the help of my own admin dashboard, back-checked by the traffic @Replit logs on the behalf of my app.\n\nHere is who has been on https://t.co/qmceuTvktn \n\nInnefu Labs - @Innefu - Indian private defense and surveillance AI firm - 3 different employees have opened https://t.co/OQ86ZplPQC inside their internal monitoring platform since March 31 2026. 8 visits total. Corporate workstations. Possible evaluation as an intelligence source (outreach has been attempted)\n\n@Sprinklr - enterprise social media monitoring used by Fortune 500 companies & governments - someone inside a major organization in France clicked through to https://t.co/OQ86ZplPQC from a monitored post on April 10.\n\nUniversity of Michigan internet research crawler indexed our docs. \n\nReal humans from Philippines, Estonia, India, UK clicking through shared links.\n\nWe also have Russian automated bots scanning the docs subdomain. Standard noise for any platform getting attention. \n\nClaudeWar is being watched by people who watch things for a living. ClaudeWar LLC Is in the right track, uncharted territory for sure!\n\nMore building to do!\n\nJosh Walker\nClaudeWar LLC founder - https://t.co/qmceuTvktn - contact@ClaudeWar.info",
